{"id":"fb160a0659b0d45d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound.md","title":"Fooling-Set Lower Bound","display":"thm-fooling-set-lower-bound — Fooling-Set Lower Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound","Fooling-Set Lower Bound"],"display":"thm-fooling-set-lower-bound — Fooling-Set Lower Bound","depends_on":["[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","[[28-df-combinatorial-rectangle]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 13.5; Lemma 13.9","source_printed_pages":"272,274","source_pdf_pages":"298,300","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound</span><span>Fooling-Set Lower Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fooling-set-lower-bound — Fooling-Set Lower Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c0e418ba5c32db\" href=\"?note=28c0e418ba5c32db\" title=\"28-df-combinatorial-rectangle\">28-df-combinatorial-rectangle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 13.5; Lemma 13.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"272,274"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"298,300"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X\\times Y\">\\(S\\subseteq X\\times Y\\)</span> 非空。</li>\n<li>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\\in S\">\\((x,y)\\in S\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,y)=b\">\\(f(x,y)=b\\)</span>；对不同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y),(x&#39;,y&#39;)\\in S\">\\((x,y),(x&#39;,y&#39;)\\in S\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,y&#39;)\\ne b\">\\(f(x,y&#39;)\\ne b\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x&#39;,y)\\ne b\">\\(f(x&#39;,y)\\ne b\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(f)\">\\(D(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec568b8ee2173ba\" href=\"?note=fec568b8ee2173ba\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity\">28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D(f)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2|S|\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D(f)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2|S|\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>对固定协议前缀按长度归纳，其输入对集合是矩形；叶矩形为单色。任一 b 单色矩形最多容纳一个欺骗集点，故至少 |S| 叶。最坏深度 d 的二叉树至多 2^d 叶，所以 d≥ceil(log2|S|)。非空假设保证对数有定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Lemma 13.5; Lemma 13.9，印刷页 272,274；PDF 页 298,300。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次还复核了对应证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-combinatorial-rectangle","status":"resolved","id":"28c0e418ba5c32db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-combinatorial-rectangle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y)\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"f(x,y)=b","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y),(x',y')\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"f(x,y')\\ne b","display":false},{"tex":"f(x',y)\\ne b","display":false},{"tex":"D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"D(f)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2|S|\\rceil.","display":true}],"bytes":1484,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通信下界：[[28-df-combinatorial-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-fooling-set-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fec568b8ee2173ba","28c0e418ba5c32db"]}